n voces y letras de death metal.", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghoul_(band)", "cita": "Ghoul plays a blend of thrash metal and grindcore with death metal vocals and lyrics."}, {"dato": "Los miembros ocultan su identidad y usan nombres artísticos: Digestor, Cremator, Dissector y Fermentor.", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghoul_(band)", "cita": "The masked members go by the stage names Digestor, Cremator, Dissector and Fermentor."}, {"dato": "Algunos integrantes o exintegrantes han tocado en otras bandas como Impaled, Exhumed, Phobia, Dystopia y Wolves in the Throne Room; llevan cinco álbumes de estudio.", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghoul_(band)", "cita": "some members or past members of Ghoul play or have played in other bands such as Impaled, Dystopia, Wolves in the Throne Room, Exhumed, Phobia, Morbid Angel, Asunder and Morbosidad. Ghoul has released five studio albums."}]}
